TI  - Transbronchial cryobiopsy to diagnose diffuse idiopathic pulmonary neuroendocrine 
      cell hyperplasia (DIPNECH).
LID - e266666 [pii]
LID - 10.1136/bcr-2025-266666 [doi]
AB  - Diffuse idiopathic pulmonary neuroendocrine cell hyperplasia (DIPNECH) is a rare 
      precursor of neuroendocrine malignancy. Diagnosis is difficult as clinical and 
      radiological findings can be non-specific. Histological confirmation is 
      necessary, and surgical lung biopsy is still considered the gold standard 
      technique to aid multidisciplinary discussion. There are increasing reports of 
      using transbronchial lung cryobiopsy (TBLC) for tissue sampling, allowing a 
      feasible and safe alternative to diagnosis. Here we present a case of cough, 
      dyspnoea and hypoxia in a woman ultimately diagnosed with DIPNECH using TBLC.
